hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"943","It was narrated by Bishr bin Muadh Al-Aqdi, narrated by Abu Awanah, on the authority of Bukair bin Al-Akhnas, on the authority of Mujahid, on the authority of Ibn Abbas, who said: “God Almighty has imposed On the tongue of your Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, he said four rak’ahs in the city, two rak’ahs when traveling, and one rak’ah in fear.”"
